  "label": "User projected onto the woman as the facilitator of illegal immigration",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the Black woman, interpreting her as the 'helper' referenced in the text, implying she facilitates illegal immigration. This projection is created by the juxtaposition of the text 'who needs help getting into the u.s i can help' with the image of the woman in a formal setting, leading the user to associate her identity with the criminalized role described in the text.",
